  {
    "id": "b85d19aa-40ec-5310-904a-ab73d0309b3b",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:the-eye-of-the-slumberer",
    "name": "The Eye of the Slumberer",
    "level": 21,
    "rarity": "unique",
    "traits": ["artifact", "occult"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4953"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is an alghollthu relic resembling a tangle of barnacle-encrusted tentacles. Though the orb is too large to move easily, the artifact's owner (referred to as the bearer) can activate its powers by wearing the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amulet of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", a companion item shaped like a barnacle-encrusted cephalopod eye; this is a worn item that has the invested and occult traits. Only one such amulet can exist at any given time, and the artifact can grow a new one in 10 minutes if the original is destroyed. The Eye's abilities that require a saving throw use the higher of the amulet wearer's spell DC or class DC."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "As one of the alghollthus' ancient contingencies to control their servitors, the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " absorbs thoughts—especially those of pain and anguish—storing them like a battery. On command, it can unleash the stored energy, potentially stunning whole ecosystems. Each time a creature with the aquatic, amphibious, or water trait falls asleep or otherwise passes the night within 1 mile of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", it dreams fitfully of the artifact; creatures that don't dream are immune to this effect. When it awakens, the creature must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": 45
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save or become friendly toward the bearer (or helpful on a critical failure) until the next time it rests; this is an emotion and mental effect. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amulet",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "'s bearer isn't automatically aware of creatures influenced in this fashion, but they can identify such creatures on sight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Open the Eye",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate, occult)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You are wearing the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amulet of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and are within 100 feet of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The amulet's eye opens and absorbs fears from creatures within a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "emanation",
            "size": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", subjecting them to nightmare as if they'd spent a night under the influence of the spell. Additionally, each creature with the dream or incorporeal trait within 500 feet of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " takes "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "20d6",
                "damageType": "force"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage ("
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": 45,
            "basic": true
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Vortex",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (occult, water)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're wearing the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amulet of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", you're within 100 feet of the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is within water"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The water around the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " churns violently in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "emanation",
            "size": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", becoming difficult terrain for swimming creatures that don't have the water trait. You can use this action again to Dismiss this effect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Destruction",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye of the Slumberer",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is destroyed if it's brought to the Dreamlands and either fed to a Great Old One or encircled by joyful celebrants for 101 days, during which time none of the dancers can experiences despair."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.L6HpgX8EsBWCRJ3u"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": 50,
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "open-the-eye",
          "name": "Open the Eye",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "0e9e360a-b98d-5d13-9123-6a0c67946733",
    "pack": "hells-destiny",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:warpriests-cascade",
    "name": "Warpriest's Cascade",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "hells-destiny",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4956"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This iron thurible—originally crafted by a Caydenite priest to disperse symbolic libations—swings from the end of an extendable shaft, allowing you to sprinkle the contents over an entire troop."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The thurible's container can hold a magical potion up to the item level of the warpriest's cascade, dispersing its contents over an entire troop over the course of 1 minute. However, spreading out the potion lessens its duration. Potions with a duration of 1 hour or more affect a troop for only 10 minutes, and potions with a duration of 8 hours or more affect a troop for only 1 hour. Potions with a duration less than 1 hour don't work inside of a warpriest's cascade."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.g9JXE1u023zcmXxk"
    },
